WEBVTT

00:09:27.621 --> 00:09:30.954
It's so true. Why do you say
human male politicians?

00:09:32.037 --> 00:09:36.996
Well, I don't think human female
politicians used the same tactics,

00:09:36.996 --> 00:09:38.246
at least I haven't seen them.

00:09:38.537 --> 00:09:41.079
I mean, I'm thinking of the last election

00:09:41.496 --> 00:09:45.204
and I'm thinking of when Hillary
Clinton was talking

00:09:45.454 --> 00:09:50.037
and Donald Trump was kind of looming, you
know, how he used to loom behind her.

00:09:50.246 --> 00:09:55.037
Yes. Threatening, swaggering way
of that was so chimpanzee like.

00:09:56.329 --> 00:09:58.537
It's so interesting to think about this,
I guess, you know,

00:09:58.912 --> 00:10:02.496
one of the things that I've long been
curious about when we see those kinds of